Description:It is your first main phase. You control Geist of Saint Traft (2/2), Grizzly Bears and three tapped Cathedrals of War (each has exalted). The opponent is at 9 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-exalted-alone | A creature attacks alone if it is the only creature declared as an attacker (CR 506.5, 702.83b); the Angel Geist puts onto the battlefield attacking was never declared, so all three exalted triggers still pump Geist: 2+3 plus the Angel's 4 is 9, while attacking with the Bears too gives 8
